#: ../../source/imperative.rst:2
msgid "Imperative UI Guide"
msgstr "命令式开发指南"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:4
msgid ""
"On the **imperative track** (``fluxent.imp``), your application drives a "
"retained ``XtkScene`` directly through atomic ``XtkTxn`` transactions, "
"typed control helpers in ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>``, and C event callbacks."
msgstr ""
"在 **命令式路线** （ ``fluxent.imp`` ）中，应用程序通过原子化 ``XtkTxn`` 事务、"
" ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` 中的强类型控件辅助函数以及 C 事件回调，直接驱动保留式 ``XtkScene`` 场景。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:10
msgid ""
"The imperative API is also Xent's stable C binding surface: ``oxent``, "
"``zxent``, ``xenthon``, and ``hsxent`` all build on these functions."
msgstr ""
"命令式 API 同时也是 Xent 稳定的多语言绑定接口： ``oxent`` 、 ``zxent`` 、 ``xenthon`` 与 ``hsxent`` 均构建于这组函数之上。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:14
msgid "Anatomy of the ``fluxent.imp`` Template"
msgstr "``fluxent.imp`` 模板代码解析"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:16
msgid ""
"Running ``xmake create -l c -t fluxent.imp hello`` scaffolds an "
"imperative counter application in ``src/main.c``:"
msgstr "执行 ``xmake create -l c -t fluxent.imp hello`` 会在 ``src/main.c`` 中生成命令式计数器工程骨架："

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:61
msgid "Core Lifecycle: App, Host, and Scene"
msgstr "核心生命周期：App、Host 与 Scene"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:63
msgid ""
"An imperative Fluxent program initializes three core objects in "
"``WinMain``:"
msgstr "命令式 Fluxent 程序在 ``WinMain`` 中按顺序初始化三个核心对象："

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:65
msgid ""
"**Register control modules**: Call "
"``flux_controls_use(&flux_ctrl_<name>)`` for each control type your "
"program creates (such as ``&flux_ctrl_container``, ``&flux_ctrl_text``, "
"``&flux_ctrl_button``), or ``flux_controls_all()`` to register the full "
"catalog."
msgstr ""
"**注册控件模块** ：对程序创建的每一种控件调用 ``flux_controls_use(&flux_ctrl_<name>)`` "
"（如 ``&flux_ctrl_container`` 、 ``&flux_ctrl_text`` 、 ``&flux_ctrl_button`` ），"
"或调用 ``flux_controls_all()`` 注册全部内置控件。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Create the window app**: ``FluxApp *app = flux_app_create(&cfg);`` sets"
" up the Win32 window, Direct2D/DirectWrite device resources, and input "
"pipeline."
msgstr ""
"**创建窗口应用实例** ： ``FluxApp *app = flux_app_create(&cfg);`` 初始化 Win32 窗口、"
"Direct2D/DirectWrite 设备资源与输入管线。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:71
msgid "**Attach the retained Host and wrap a Scene**:"
msgstr "**挂载保留式 Host 并构造 Scene** ："

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:78
msgid ""
"``XtkHost`` owns the live controls and validates batches; ``XtkScene`` is"
" a lightweight value handle passed to ``xtk_txn_*`` and ``xtk_<ctrl>_*`` "
"functions."
msgstr ""
"``XtkHost`` 持有活动控件实例并校验事务批次； ``XtkScene`` 是传给 ``xtk_txn_*`` 与 "
"``xtk_<ctrl>_*`` 函数的轻量值包装结构。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:81
msgid ""
"**Run and shut down in reverse order**: Build your initial control tree, "
"run the event loop with ``flux_app_run(app)``, clear any frame callback "
"with ``flux_app_onframe(app, NULL, NULL)``, destroy the host via "
"``flux_host_destroy(host)``, and destroy the app via "
"``flux_app_destroy(app)``."
msgstr ""
"**运行并按逆序释放资源** ：构建初始控件树后调用 ``flux_app_run(app)`` 进入事件循环；退出后依次通过 "
"``flux_app_onframe(app, NULL, NULL)`` 清空帧回调、 ``flux_host_destroy(host)`` 销毁宿主、"
" ``flux_app_destroy(app)`` 销毁应用实例。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:88
msgid "Building Controls with Atomic Transactions (``XtkTxn``)"
msgstr "使用原子事务（ ``XtkTxn`` ）构建控件"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:90
msgid ""
"Tree mutations—creating controls, inserting/moving/dropping nodes, and "
"attaching initial event listeners—execute inside an ``XtkTxn`` "
"transaction. The host validates and commits the entire transaction "
"atomically so every operation succeeds together."
msgstr ""
"树结构变更（创建控件、插入/移动/销毁节点、挂载初始事件监听）都在 ``XtkTxn`` 事务中执行。"
"宿主会对整个事务做统一校验并原子提交，确保批次内的所有操作同时生效。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:96
msgid "1. Begin a Transaction"
msgstr "1. 开启事务"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:104
msgid "2. Create Controls with ``.set`` Property Bitmasks"
msgstr "2. 使用 ``.set`` 属性位掩码创建控件"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:106
msgid ""
"Because ``0`` is a valid value for numeric and enum properties in C, "
"typed ``Xtk<Ctrl>Props`` structs in ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` pair "
"property fields with an explicit ``.set`` bitmask indicating which "
"properties to apply:"
msgstr ""
"由于在 C 语言中 ``0`` 本身是合法的数值与枚举值， ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` 中的 ``Xtk<Ctrl>Props`` "
"结构体通过显式的 ``.set`` 位掩码指明本次要写入哪些属性字段："

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:125
msgid ""
"Include the corresponding ``XTK_<CTRL>_<PROP>_MASK`` bit in ``.set`` for "
"every property field you assign. String properties take explicit pointer "
"and UTF-8 byte-length pairs (for example ``.text`` and ``.text_len``)."
msgstr ""
"凡是赋值的属性字段，都应在 ``.set`` 中按位或（ ``|`` ）上对应的 ``XTK_<CTRL>_<PROP>_MASK`` 标志位。"
"字符串属性同时接收指针与 UTF-8 字节长度字段对（如 ``.text`` 与 ``.text_len`` ）。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:130
msgid "3. Reference Controls via ``XtkNodeRef``"
msgstr "3. 通过 ``XtkNodeRef`` 引用节点"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:132
msgid ""
"Within an open transaction, ``xtk_*_create`` functions return a batch-"
"local ``XtkLocalId``, and operations accepting a parent or target take an"
" ``XtkNodeRef``:"
msgstr ""
"在尚未提交的事务内， ``xtk_*_create`` 返回批次内局部编号 ``XtkLocalId`` ，接收父节点或目标节点的函数统一使用 ``XtkNodeRef`` ："

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:136
msgid ""
"``xtk_ref_existing(ctrl)`` — References an already-committed ``XtkCtrl`` "
"(such as ``xtk_scene_root(&scene)``)."
msgstr "``xtk_ref_existing(ctrl)`` —— 引用已提交的现有 ``XtkCtrl`` 句柄（如 ``xtk_scene_root(&scene)`` ）。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:138
msgid ""
"``xtk_ref_local(local_id)`` — References a control created earlier in the"
" same ``XtkTxn``."
msgstr "``xtk_ref_local(local_id)`` —— 引用当前同一个 ``XtkTxn`` 中刚刚创建的节点。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:140
msgid ""
"``xtk_ref_none()`` — Null reference (used as ``before`` when appending to"
" the end of a container)."
msgstr "``xtk_ref_none()`` —— 空引用（追加到容器末尾时作为 ``before`` 参数传入）。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:144
msgid "4. Commit and Extract Persistent ``XtkCtrl`` Handles"
msgstr "4. 提交事务并提取持久 ``XtkCtrl`` 句柄"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:146
msgid ""
"For any control you plan to update later (such as the ``Value: 0`` text "
"node), map its ``XtkLocalId`` to a generation-checked ``XtkCtrl`` handle "
"from the ``XtkBatchResult *`` returned by ``xtk_txn_commit``:"
msgstr ""
"对于后续需要动态修改属性的控件（例如显示 ``Value: 0`` 的文本节点），在 ``xtk_txn_commit`` 返回的 "
"``XtkBatchResult *`` 中将其 ``XtkLocalId`` 映射为带代次校验的持久 ``XtkCtrl`` 句柄："

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:166
msgid ""
"Release every non-NULL ``XtkBatchResult *`` with "
"``xtk_batchresult_destroy``. To discard an open transaction prior to "
"commit, call ``xtk_txn_abort(&txn)``."
msgstr ""
"使用完非空的 ``XtkBatchResult *`` 后调用 ``xtk_batchresult_destroy`` 释放结果对象；"
"若要在提交前放弃当前事务，调用 ``xtk_txn_abort(&txn)`` 。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:170
msgid "Subscribing to Events"
msgstr "订阅控件事件"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:172
msgid ""
"Generated helpers in ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` register typed event "
"callbacks inside a transaction:"
msgstr "``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>`` 中生成的辅助函数可在事务内为各控件注册类型化事件回调："

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:179
msgid ""
"For custom phase routing (``XTK_EVENT_PHASE_MASK_CAPTURE``, ``TARGET``, "
"``BUBBLE``) or dynamic subscriptions, use ``xtk_txn_on`` inside a "
"transaction or ``flux_host_subscribe`` on the host."
msgstr ""
"如需自定义事件传播阶段（ ``XTK_EVENT_PHASE_MASK_CAPTURE`` 、 ``TARGET`` 、 ``BUBBLE`` ）或动态增删监听，"
"可在事务内调用 ``xtk_txn_on`` ，或直接在宿主上调用 ``flux_host_subscribe`` 。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:184
msgid "Event Callback Conventions"
msgstr "事件回调约定"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:186
msgid "An ``XtkEventFn`` uses the signature:"
msgstr "``XtkEventFn`` 回调函数的签名为："

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:192
msgid ""
"Read typed event data from ``event->payload`` (``u.b``, ``u.i32``, "
"``u.f32``, ``u.f64``, ``u.string``, ``u.window``, ``u.scroll``)."
msgstr ""
"从 ``event->payload`` 读取对应类型的载荷数据（ ``u.b`` 、 ``u.i32`` 、 ``u.f32`` 、 "
"``u.f64`` 、 ``u.string`` 、 ``u.window`` 、 ``u.scroll`` ）。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:194
msgid ""
"Copy string slices in ``event->payload.u.string`` and ``u.query`` during "
"the callback whenever you need to retain them afterwards."
msgstr "若需在回调返回后继续保存 ``event->payload.u.string`` 或 ``u.query`` 中的字符串切片，请在回调执行期间将其拷贝出来。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:196
msgid ""
"Return ``XTK_EVENT_HANDLED`` (optionally combined with flags from "
"``XtkEventDisposition`` such as ``XTK_EVENT_STOP_PROPAGATION``) when "
"handled, or ``XTK_EVENT_CONTINUE`` (``0``) to continue routing."
msgstr ""
"处理完成后返回 ``XTK_EVENT_HANDLED`` （可与 ``XtkEventDisposition`` 中的 ``XTK_EVENT_STOP_PROPAGATION`` 等标志位组合），"
"继续向下传递则返回 ``XTK_EVENT_CONTINUE`` （ ``0`` ）。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:201
msgid "Coalescing Updates with Frame Callbacks"
msgstr "利用帧回调合并属性更新"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:203
msgid ""
"To update a single property on a committed ``XtkCtrl`` from the UI "
"thread, call the generated typed setter (such as "
"``xtk_text_settext(&scene, ctrl, buf, len, stamp)``) or the generic "
"``xtk_ctrl_set*`` helpers in ``<xtk/xtk_scene.h>``."
msgstr ""
"在 UI 线程上更新已提交 ``XtkCtrl`` 的单个属性时，可调用生成的强类型 setter（如 "
"``xtk_text_settext(&scene, ctrl, buf, len, stamp)`` ）或 ``<xtk/xtk_scene.h>`` 中的通用 ``xtk_ctrl_set*`` 函数。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:207
msgid ""
"When several input events arrive before the next vertical blank, coalesce"
" UI writes using ``flux_app_onframe`` as shown in the ``fluxent.imp`` "
"template:"
msgstr "当同一帧垂直同步前可能到达多次输入事件时，可按 ``fluxent.imp`` 模板的方式通过 ``flux_app_onframe`` 合并属性写入："

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:210
msgid ""
"Register a frame callback once via ``flux_app_onframe(app, frame, "
"&state)``."
msgstr "初始化时调用 ``flux_app_onframe(app, frame, &state)`` 注册一次帧回调。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:211
msgid ""
"Inside event callbacks, update your C struct, set ``dirty = true``, and "
"call ``flux_app_redraw(app)``."
msgstr "在事件回调中更新业务结构体、标记 ``dirty = true`` ，并调用 ``flux_app_redraw(app)`` 请求重绘。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:213
msgid "Inside ``frame()``, flush the updated properties right before rendering."
msgstr "在 ``frame()`` 回调中，于渲染前统一写入变更后的控件属性。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:215
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Pass a zero-initialized ``(XtkChangeStamp) {0}`` for ordinary "
"programmatic writes."
msgstr "普通的程序端属性写入传入零初始化的 ``(XtkChangeStamp) {0}`` 即可。"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:219
msgid "Browsing Imperative Examples"
msgstr "浏览命令式示例库"

#: ../../source/imperative.rst:221
msgid ""
"The ``fluxent`` repository provides a complete imperative implementation "
"of the Control Gallery under ``examples/gallery_imp/``. Run ``xmake run "
"fluxent_gallery_imp`` inside a ``fluxent`` checkout to explore every "
"control and compare it alongside ``examples/gallery_decl/``."
msgstr ""
"``fluxent`` 仓库在 ``examples/gallery_imp/`` 下提供了完整控件画廊的命令式实现。"
"在克隆的 ``fluxent`` 仓库中执行 ``xmake run fluxent_gallery_imp`` 即可运行并与 ``examples/gallery_decl/`` 对照查阅。"
